      weeklyChallenge:
        "This week, approach at least one of the people on your discipleship list and have an honest conversation about spiritual growth. Invite them to meet with you regularly for the purpose of growing together in faith and equipping one another for witness. If they agree, schedule your first meeting. Remember: the candlestick does not hoard its oil — it pours itself out so that every lamp can burn.",
